 misdelivery case. Low frequency because 30-day retention usually removes t=
he outbox copy anyway.</p>
<p class=3D"fld fix"><span class=3D"fldlabel">Suggested fix</span>Paginate =
or filter listActions by the specific txid, and store the recipient identit=
y durably with the action so old payments remain addressable and verifiable=
.</p>
<p class=3D"fld corr"><span class=3D"fldlabel">Verifier=E2=80=99s correctio=
n</span>Persist recipient/txid for rebuild independently of the 1000-action=
 cache (e.g. longer outbox retention or a dedicated txid=E2=86=92recipient =
index), and stop relying on labels to recover the recipient.</p>
