leResendRequests fall back to matching the outbox by the `messageId` field =
when `txid` does not resolve, or have discardIncoming omit the resend_reque=
st entirely when no atomic txid is available (nothing can be rebuilt for a =
corrupt token).</p>
<p class=3D"fld corr"><span class=3D"fldlabel">Verifier=E2=80=99s correctio=
n</span>Have discardIncoming avoid emitting an unresolvable request for unp=
arseable tokens (or mark it so the sender can ack/drop it), and give handle=
