e">Post-restore validate pass stalls the import UI at the final chunk and a=
ny throw fails an already-successful restore</span><span class=3D"vtag v-co=
nfirmed">Confirmed</span></summary>
<div class=3D"fbody">
<p class=3D"fld"><span class=3D"fldlabel">When it happens</span>User import=
