.</p>
<p class=3D"fld"><span class=3D"fldlabel">The defect</span>restoreOnImport.=
ts:87-90 awaits validateRestoredCoins before resolving, and WalletContext.t=
sx:1092-1095 implements it as reviewSpendableOutputs(false, true) =E2=80=94=
