 failures). onProgress last fired at the final chunk, so the restore UI sit=
s at 'restoring, chunks=3D=3Dtotal' with zero feedback for the entire scan =
=E2=80=94 minutes on a big wallet =E2=80=94 inviting the user to kill the a=
pp mid-import. Separately, if the pass throws (StorageExpoSQLite.transactio=
n's disk-pressure guard, an addWalletStorageProvider failure inside the hoo=
k, or an unhandled rejection out of runWithConcurrency), the catch at Walle=
tContext.tsx:1106-1111 marks the whole restore 'failed' and rethrows, abort=
ing the wallet build even though the replay itself completed =E2=80=94 a va=
lidation convenience converted into an import-blocking dependency. (And per=
