etContext.tsx:2415-2471) exists to repair.</p>
<p class=3D"fld"><span class=3D"fldlabel">The defect</span>In the reviewSpe=
ndable port (WalletCheckScreen.tsx:129-147) the specOpInvalidChange ['all',=
