<p class=3D"fld"><span class=3D"fldlabel">The defect</span>Four distinct tr=
uthfulness gaps: (1) freedCoins (runWalletCheck.ts:42) sums spec-op release=
s and 'stale output(s) marked unspendable' =E2=80=94 outputs REMOVED from t=
he spendable balance =E2=80=94 yet the copy says 'Freed N stuck coins' whil=
e the visible balance goes DOWN; only restoredInputs are genuinely freed. (=
2) reviewSpendable's `recovered` (internalized spending txs, the step's bes=
t outcome) is returned but never added to recoveredPayments (runWalletCheck=
.ts:43 uses only inbox.accepted + sweep.imported). (3) checkProofs (WalletC=
heckScreen.tsx:150-157) unconditionally returns { repaired: 0 }, so repaire=
dProofs is dead. (4) runMonitorTask('CheckForProofs') silently does nothing=
 when monitor.lastNewHeader is undefined (TaskCheckForProofs.js:47-50 =E2=
=80=94 fresh boot or offline), yet the step shows as completed. Additionall=
