e">A payment credited by TaskCreditInbox produces no user-visible notificat=
ion anywhere</span><span class=3D"vtag v-confirmed">Confirmed</span></summa=
ry>
<div class=3D"fbody">
<p class=3D"fld"><span class=3D"fldlabel">When it happens</span>The app is =
open on Home (or the user opens Get Paid seconds after the task's pass) whi=
le TaskCreditInbox's 10s pass credits an arriving payment.</p>
<p class=3D"fld"><span class=3D"fldlabel">The defect</span>The task callbac=
