<p class=3D"fld corr"><span class=3D"fldlabel">Verifier=E2=80=99s correctio=
n</span>The money is not invisible in the ledger =E2=80=94 balance and acti=
vity refresh on the next txStatusVersion bump/focus =E2=80=94 but no notifi=
